IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WFL-EDSAC-ISOMORPHISM.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 D1-C-RUNTIME-STREAM.
   05 D1-C-FORWARD-U       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
   05 D1-C-BACK-V          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-C-TOTIENT-VAL     PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-PYTHON-WFL-STREAM.
   05 D2-PY-FORWARD-U      PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-PY-BACK-V         PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-PY-TOTIENT-VAL    PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-ISOMORPHISM-EVAL.
   05 D3-ISOMORPHISM-RULING PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.

    IF D1-C-FORWARD-U == D2-PY-FORWARD-U AND
       D1-C-BACK-V == D2-PY-BACK-V AND
       D1-C-TOTIENT-VAL == 0 AND
       D2-PY-TOTIENT-VAL == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-ISOMORPHISM-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 2 TO D3-ISOMORPHISM-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = (D1-C-FORWARD-U - D1-C-BACK-V) - (((D1-C-FORWARD-U - D1-C-BACK-V) / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
